ified guanosine with a tricyclic base located at position 37 of eukaryotic phenylalanine tRNA (tRNA(Phe)) that contributes to maintenance of the translational reading frame (By similarity). Catalyzes the condensation of N-methylguanine with 2 carbon atoms from pyruvate to form the tricyclic 4-demethylwyosine, an intermediate in wybutosine biosynthesis (By similarity)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}